{"content_hash": "c5311335fb2c75ee", "version_id": 844, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Saudi Aramco buys 49% of AI firm HUMAIN from PIF", "title_zh": "沙特阿美买下本国AI公司HUMAIN 49%的股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 214, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Saudi Arabia's state oil giant is moving deeper into artificial intelligence. Aramco will take a large stake in HUMAIN, an AI company owned by the country's sovereign wealth fund, and plans to hand over key AI assets as part of the deal.", "lead_zh": "沙特国有石油巨头正在进一步布局人工智能。沙特阿美将收购本国主权财富基金旗下AI公司HUMAIN的大笔股份，并计划在交易中转让关键AI资产。", "preview": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup previously controlled entirely by Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund PIF, announced on the firs", "preview_zh": "此前由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资控股的人工智能初创公司HUMAIN本月1日宣布，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份。公共投资基金将保留其余51%的股份，因此仍为控股方。这一消息由中文科技媒体IT之家报道。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 828, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 88.825, "size_bytes": 533952, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 237, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 89.725, "size_bytes": 539280, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 237, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 96.15, "size_bytes": 577872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 237, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 83.325, "size_bytes": 500976, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 237, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 89.875, "size_bytes": 540144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 237, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@838767a/content/data/versions/844.json", "paragraphs": ["HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup previously controlled entirely by Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund PIF, announced on the first of this month that Aramco will acquire 49% of its shares. The Public Investment Fund will keep the remaining 51%, so it stays the majority owner. The announcement was reported by the Chinese tech news site IT Home.", "Aramco, the world's largest petrochemical company, plans to fund the deal by transferring key AI assets and injecting about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. The move shows how the oil producer is trying to build a stronger position in advanced technology, while the fund keeps control of the company it created.", "Aramco expects to use HUMAIN's AI infrastructure to turn advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications. In practice, that means applying AI tools to its own operations, which the company says will further strengthen its global ecosystem and operational capacity. The deal ties the country's biggest energy firm to its flagship AI project.", "The purchase is part of a wider push by Saudi Arabia to become a regional technology hub. HUMAIN has already released Arabic-language AI models, announced laptops, and worked with chip and networking companies on computing power inside the kingdom. Aramco's stake gives that effort a major industrial partner and a large source of real-world data."], "paragraphs_zh": ["此前由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资控股的人工智能初创公司HUMAIN本月1日宣布，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份。公共投资基金将保留其余51%的股份，因此仍为控股方。这一消息由中文科技媒体IT之家报道。", "作为全球最大的石化企业，沙特阿美计划通过转让关键AI资产并注资约99亿沙特里亚尔来完成这笔交易。此举显示这家石油生产商正努力在先进技术领域建立更强地位，而基金仍掌控着自己创立的公司。", "沙特阿美预计将利用HUMAIN的AI基础设施，把先进的人工智能能力转化为工业应用。实际来看，这意味着把AI工具用到自身业务中，公司称这将进一步增强其全球生态和运营能力。这笔交易把该国最大的能源企业与旗舰AI项目绑在了一起。", "此次收购是沙特推动自身成为地区科技中心的更大布局的一部分。HUMAIN已经发布了阿拉伯语AI模型，公布了笔记本电脑产品，并与芯片和网络公司合作在沙特境内建设算力。沙特阿美的入股为这一努力带来了重要的工业伙伴和大量真实场景数据。"], "body": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup previously controlled entirely by Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund PIF, announced on the first of this month that Aramco will acquire 49% of its shares. The Public Investment Fund will keep the remaining 51%, so it stays the majority owner. The announcement was reported by the Chinese tech news site IT Home.\n\nAramco, the world's largest petrochemical company, plans to fund the deal by transferring key AI assets and injecting about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. The move shows how the oil producer is trying to build a stronger position in advanced technology, while the fund keeps control of the company it created.\n\nAramco expects to use HUMAIN's AI infrastructure to turn advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications. In practice, that means applying AI tools to its own operations, which the company says will further strengthen its global ecosystem and operational capacity. The deal ties the country's biggest energy firm to its flagship AI project.\n\nThe purchase is part of a wider push by Saudi Arabia to become a regional technology hub. HUMAIN has already released Arabic-language AI models, announced laptops, and worked with chip and networking companies on computing power inside the kingdom. Aramco's stake gives that effort a major industrial partner and a large source of real-world data.", "body_zh": "此前由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资控股的人工智能初创公司HUMAIN本月1日宣布，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份。公共投资基金将保留其余51%的股份，因此仍为控股方。这一消息由中文科技媒体IT之家报道。\n\n作为全球最大的石化企业，沙特阿美计划通过转让关键AI资产并注资约99亿沙特里亚尔来完成这笔交易。此举显示这家石油生产商正努力在先进技术领域建立更强地位，而基金仍掌控着自己创立的公司。\n\n沙特阿美预计将利用HUMAIN的AI基础设施，把先进的人工智能能力转化为工业应用。实际来看，这意味着把AI工具用到自身业务中，公司称这将进一步增强其全球生态和运营能力。这笔交易把该国最大的能源企业与旗舰AI项目绑在了一起。\n\n此次收购是沙特推动自身成为地区科技中心的更大布局的一部分。HUMAIN已经发布了阿拉伯语AI模型，公布了笔记本电脑产品，并与芯片和网络公司合作在沙特境内建设算力。沙特阿美的入股为这一努力带来了重要的工业伙伴和大量真实场景数据。", "text": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup previously controlled entirely by Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund PIF, announced on the first of this month that Aramco will acquire 49% of its shares. The Public Investment Fund will keep the remaining 51%, so it stays the majority owner. The announcement was reported by the Chinese tech news site IT Home. Aramco, the world's largest petrochemical company, plans to fund the deal by transferring key AI assets and injecting about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. The move shows how the oil producer is trying to build a stronger position in advanced technology, while the fund keeps control of the company it created. Aramco expects to use HUMAIN's AI infrastructure to turn advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications. In practice, that means applying AI tools to its own operations, which the company says will further strengthen its global ecosystem and operational capacity. The deal ties the country's biggest energy firm to its flagship AI project. The purchase is part of a wider push by Saudi Arabia to become a regional technology hub. HUMAIN has already released Arabic-language AI models, announced laptops, and worked with chip and networking companies on computing power inside the kingdom. Aramco's stake gives that effort a major industrial partner and a large source of real-world data.", "vocab": [{"word": "acquire", "pos": "verb", "zh": "收购；获得", "note": "商业新闻高频词，比buy正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份；股份比例", "note": "take a stake in 表示入股", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sovereign wealth fund", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主权财富基金", "note": "指国家设立的投资基金", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "majority owner", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "控股方；多数股权持有者", "note": "与minority owner相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inject", "pos": "verb", "zh": "注入（资金）", "note": "inject money into 常见搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "petrochemical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "石化的", "note": "petrochemical company 石化企业", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "infrastructure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基础设施", "note": "此处指算力等AI基础条件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "capability", "pos": "noun", "zh": "能力；性能", "note": "常用复数 capabilities", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "operational", "pos": "adj", "zh": "运营的；运营层面的", "note": "operational capacity 运营能力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "adj", "zh": "旗舰的；最重要的", "note": "flagship project 旗舰项目", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "regional", "pos": "adj", "zh": "地区的；区域性的", "note": "regional hub 地区中心", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "computing power", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "算力", "note": "AI话题常见表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-02T00:59:06.345153", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "HUMAIN", "s": 0.3, "e": 1.45, "sm": 300, "em": 1450, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": ",", "s": 1.45, "e": 1.5